'''Mighty Deth-Troy-R''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] event. It was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]] increases damage and grants Freeze Immunity. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]].

