==Trivia==
*The Cat on top of the Mighty Deth-Troy-R might be a reference to [[wikipedia:The Sword in the Stone (novel)|The Sword in the Stone]] and [[wikipedia:Excalibur|Excalibur]].
*Mighty Deth-Troy-R's English name is a play on words that combines the words "death" and "destroyer".
**Mighty Deth-Troy-R's name is also a play on the city of [[Wikipedia:Troy|Troy]], which the trojan horse was given to.
*Mighty Deth-Troy-R parodies the mythical siege weapon, the [[wikipedia:Trojan Horse|Trojan Horse]].
**Because they are both designed after the Trojan Horse, Mighty Deth-Troy-R could also be partially based off of [[Entangled Wooden Horse Javelins (PC Uber Rare Cat)|Entangled Wooden Horse Javelins]].
*Siege Walker Diabolosa's design is a parody of the [[Wikipedia:AT-ST|AT-ST]] from [[Wikipedia:Star Wars|Star Wars]].

